 "description": "Every stablecoin's circulating supply, 1 d/7 d/30 d supply change, current price and peg deviation \u2014 spot depegs and mint/burn flows. DefiLlama stablecoin data across all chains. Filter by symbol or peg type. peg_deviation_pct is measured against the peg (USD, EUR\u2026) using DefiLlama's price. Price: free. Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
